        {
          "source_quote": "ἵνα ὑνερπολῇ καὶ χρηματίζῃ",
          "english_quote": "so that they might give oracles",
          "issue": "The English translates χρηματίζῃ but leaves the first coordinated verb, ὑνερπολῇ, untranslated. The source_issues note correctly acknowledges that missing contribution, but the main text remains incomplete. This is not a printed lacuna, and image verification of the edition does not establish the word's meaning.",
          "suggested_revision": "Obtain a documented lexical explanation of the supplied ὑνερπολῇ or scholarly evidence supporting a clearly labeled proposed correction. Preserve the distinction between the verified printed form and any correction; do not silently substitute another verb or invent gap markers. Translate both coordinated actions once a defensible account is established, then submit the revised clause for fresh review.",
          "severity": "blocking"
        }
      ]
    }
